## Verification & Expected Outcome
Run `verify.sh` or test with `kubectl`:
```bash
kubectl exec deployment/app-server -- nslookup kubernetes.default
```
Expected Output:
```
Server:         10.96.0.10
Address:        10.96.0.10#53

Name:   kubernetes.default.svc.cluster.local
Address: 10.96.0.1
```
DNS resolution completes instantly returning the valid cluster IP address with zero errors.
